            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Verizon North Inc. (North Central Region) and the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers, Local 986 agree to the provisions concerning the newly established classification of Customer Engineer-Data Applications set forth in this Memorandum of Agreement.",
